# ==============================================================================
# LOGISTEL DEVELOPER API — REST CLIENT TEST SUITE (.http)
# ==============================================================================
# Instructions:
# 1. Paste your generated API key (from Tenant Dashboard) into @apiKey below.
# 2. Click "Send Request" right above any request to test it in VS Code!
# ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@apiKey = lgs_live_xUzuhVHNopOcKs4NKaUiYOe43Gw8On3qTJp0IrjJUXo

###
# 1. VERIFY API KEY STATUS
# Returns key name and confirms your key is valid and active.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/v1/me
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}


###
# 2. GET INSTANT PRICE QUOTE
# Calculates distance and fare between Surulere and Victoria Island.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/public/v1/quotes
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleType": "BIKE",
  "pickup": {
    "latitude": 6.4975,
    "longitude": 3.3644
  },
  "dropoff": {
    "latitude": 6.4281,
    "longitude": 3.4219
  }
}


###
# 3. BOOK / CREATE A SHIPMENT
# Dispatches an order to the fleet and generates a receiver OTP code.
# Notice: Sending the same 'reference' twice prevents duplicate billing!
# @name createShipment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/public/v1/shipments
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reference": "ORDER-1001",
  "vehicleType": "BIKE",
  "pickup": {
    "address": "14 Broad Street, Lagos Island, Lagos",
    "latitude": 6.4549,
    "longitude": 3.3886,
    "phone": "+2348012345678"
  },
  "dropoff": {
    "address": "23 Admiralty Way, Lekki Phase 1, Lagos",
    "latitude": 6.4474,
    "longitude": 3.4708
  },
  "recipient": {
    "name": "Chidinma Okafor",
    "phone": "+2348098765432",
    "email": "chidinma@example.com"
  }
}


###
# 4. LIST ALL YOUR CREATED SHIPMENTS
# Paginated list of deliveries booked under this API key.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/v1/shipments?page=1&limit=10
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}


###
# 5. GET SINGLE SHIPMENT STATUS & LIVE TRACKING
# Shows package status, OSRM route, and live driver GPS coordinates once assigned.
# Automatically captures the ID from request #3 (createShipment) above:
@shipmentId = {{createShipment.response.body.data.id}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/v1/shipments/{{shipmentId}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}


###
# 6. CANCEL A SHIPMENT
# Cancels an order before it has been picked up by a driver.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/public/v1/shipments/{{shipmentId}}/cancel
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
